#: ../../contributing.rst:4
msgid "Contributing"
msgstr "参与贡献"

#: ../../contributing.rst:6
msgid ""
"ANet consists of three repositories, ``ANet`` (the node program, the "
"command line and these documents), ``ANetHub`` (the hub) and ``ANetCore``"
" (the protocol and cryptography kernel). This page describes how to build"
" and test them, what is expected of a change, and how contributions are "
"licensed."
msgstr ""
"ANet 由三个代码仓库组成：``ANet``\\ （节点程序、命令行及本文档）、\\ ``ANetHub``\\ （Hub）和 "
"``ANetCore``\\ （协议与密码学内核）。本页说明如何构建和测试它们、对变更的要求，以及贡献的许可方式。"

#: ../../contributing.rst:17
msgid "Ground rules"
msgstr "基本规则"

#: ../../contributing.rst:19
msgid ""
"Changes to the protocol are discussed in an issue before a pull request "
"is opened. This covers wire formats, signatures and content identifiers. "
"Protocol bytes do not change after a release: key numbers, labels and "
"codes are never reused, and every change of the register "
"(``wire/registry.json`` in ANetCore) is made together with the "
"specification and the affected golden vectors."
msgstr ""
"对协议的变更须先在议题中讨论，再提交拉取请求，范围包括线路格式、签名和内容标识符。协议字节在发布之后不再变更：密钥编号、标签和代码永不复用，对注册表（ANetCore"
" 中的 ``wire/registry.json``）的每项变更，须与规范及受影响的标准向量一并提交。"

#: ../../contributing.rst:24
msgid ""
"Bug fixes, documentation, tests and portability fixes are welcome without"
" prior discussion."
msgstr "缺陷修复、文档、测试和可移植性修复无需事先讨论。"

#: ../../contributing.rst:25
msgid ""
"A change that alters a sentence shown to a person, a command, a "
"configuration key or a reason code updates the documentation in the same "
"pull request."
msgstr "凡更改了向用户显示的语句、命令、配置键或原因码的变更，须在同一拉取请求中更新文档。"

#: ../../contributing.rst:27
msgid ""
"Do not report vulnerabilities in public issues. See :ref:`reference-"
"security` and ``SECURITY.md``."
msgstr "请勿在公开议题中报告漏洞。参见 :ref:`reference-security` 与 ``SECURITY.md``\\ 。"

#: ../../contributing.rst:31
msgid "Building and testing"
msgstr "构建与测试"

#: ../../contributing.rst:33
msgid ""
"The programs are written in Go (version 1.26 or later) and are pure Go: "
"``CGO_ENABLED=0`` and no build tag are needed for the default build."
msgstr "程序以 Go（1.26 或更高版本）编写，且为纯 Go：默认构建无需 ``CGO_ENABLED=0``，也无需任何构建标签。"

#: ../../contributing.rst:41
msgid ""
"The race detector needs cgo and a long timeout, because the tests of the "
"daemon alone run for more than ten minutes under it:"
msgstr "竞态检测器需要 cgo 和较长的超时时间，因为仅守护进程的测试在其下就要运行十分钟以上："

#: ../../contributing.rst:49
msgid "Build tags"
msgstr "构建标签"

#: ../../contributing.rst:51
msgid ""
"Tags come in two directions. A *subtractive* tag removes a module that is"
" built in by default: ``no_anetlink``, ``no_p2p``, ``no_blackboard``, "
"``no_org``, ``no_cas``, ``no_service``, ``no_mcp``, ``no_x402`` and "
"``no_a2a``. An *additive* tag adds a module that is absent by default: "
"``shell``. ``go test ./...`` does not see code behind an additive tag, so"
" run ``go vet`` and ``go test`` with ``-tags shell`` as well. ``bash "
"scripts/tagcheck.sh all`` checks every tag by the number of symbols in "
"its own direction; ``build.sh --check`` and the continuous integration "
"both call it. A new optional module gets its tag in that script and a row"
" in ``.github/workflows/ci.yml``. See :doc:`topics/modules`."
msgstr ""
"标签分为两个方向。*减法*\\ 标签移除默认内置的模块：``no_anetlink``\\ 、\\ ``no_p2p``\\ 、\\ "
"``no_blackboard``\\ 、\\ ``no_org``\\ 、\\ ``no_cas``\\ 、\\ "
"``no_service``\\ 、\\ ``no_mcp``\\ 、\\ ``no_x402`` 和 ``no_a2a``\\ 。*加法*\\ "
"标签加入默认不含的模块：``shell``\\ 。\\ ``go test ./...`` 看不到加法标签之后的代码，因此还须使用 ``-tags"
" shell`` 运行 ``go vet`` 和 ``go test``\\ 。\\ ``bash scripts/tagcheck.sh "
"all`` 按各标签自身方向上的符号数量检查每个标签，``build.sh --check`` "
"与持续集成均会调用它。新的可选模块须在该脚本中添加其标签，并在 ``.github/workflows/ci.yml`` 中添加一行。参见 "
":doc:`topics/modules`\\ 。"

#: ../../contributing.rst:61
msgid "Tests"
msgstr "测试"

#: ../../contributing.rst:63
msgid ""
"Tests live next to the code. The daemon package has an in-memory fake hub"
" for end-to-end tests without a real hub. Wire objects are pinned by "
"golden vectors in ``ANetCore/golden``: the bytes of an encoding are the "
"oracle, and two repositories that share an object (for example the C1 "
"interface between ``anet`` and ANetLink) carry byte-identical copies of "
"the vectors."
msgstr ""
"测试与代码放在一起。守护进程包带有内存中的模拟 Hub，用于无需真实 Hub 的端到端测试。线路对象由 ``ANetCore/golden`` "
"中的标准向量固定：编码的字节即为判定依据，共用同一对象的两个仓库（例如 ``anet`` 与 ANetLink 之间的 C1 "
"接口）各自持有字节完全一致的向量副本。"

#: ../../contributing.rst:69 ../../contributing.rst:95
msgid "Style"
msgstr "风格"

#: ../../contributing.rst:71
msgid ""
"Code is ``gofmt``-clean and follows the comment style of the surrounding "
"files."
msgstr "代码须通过 ``gofmt``，并遵循所在文件的注释风格。"

#: ../../contributing.rst:72
msgid ""
"The reason table (``internal/a2ashape/reasons.go``) is the only place for"
" sentences that are shown to a person. The command line does not write "
"reason sentences of its own."
msgstr "原因表（``internal/a2ashape/reasons.go``）是向用户显示的语句的唯一来源。命令行不自行撰写原因语句。"

#: ../../contributing.rst:74
msgid "Sentences are written in the style described in the next section."
msgstr "语句按下一节所述的风格撰写。"

#: ../../contributing.rst:78
msgid "Documentation"
msgstr "文档"

#: ../../contributing.rst:80
msgid ""
"The documentation is written in reStructuredText with Sphinx and the Read"
" the Docs theme. English is the source language; Chinese is translated "
"with ``sphinx-intl`` from gettext catalogs."
msgstr ""
"文档以 reStructuredText 编写，使用 Sphinx 和 Read the Docs 主题。英文为源语言，中文通过 "
"``sphinx-intl`` 基于 gettext 目录翻译。"

#: ../../contributing.rst:89
msgid ""
"The build runs with ``-W --keep-going``, so every warning fails it. A "
"page that adds a command, a configuration key or a code must give its "
"source in the code or in the specification. The pages of the reference "
"are generated where the source of the programs has the data: the command "
"index, the reason codes, the hub codes and the wire tables (the scripts "
"are in ``docs/_tools``)."
msgstr ""
"构建使用 ``-W --keep-going`` "
"运行，因此任何警告都会导致构建失败。新增命令、配置键或代码的页面，必须在代码或规范中给出其依据。参考部分的页面在程序源码持有数据之处生成：命令索引、原因码、Hub"
" 代码和线路表（脚本位于 ``docs/_tools``）。"

#: ../../contributing.rst:97
msgid ""
"Write in a formal, restrained register. Use noun phrases as headings and "
"complete declarative sentences as explanations. Do not use colloquial "
"language, exclamation marks, rhetorical questions or emoji. Do not "
"personify the software."
msgstr "采用正式、克制的语体。标题使用名词短语，说明使用完整的陈述句。不使用口语、感叹号、反问句或表情符号，不将软件拟人化。"

#: ../../contributing.rst:100
msgid ""
"Do not address the reader directly in descriptions. Use roles such as "
"operator, caller and node. An imperative is acceptable for a step in a "
"procedure."
msgstr "描述中不直接称呼读者，使用运维者、调用方和节点等角色。操作步骤可以使用祈使句。"

#: ../../contributing.rst:102
msgid ""
"Use the terms of the :ref:`glossary <reference-glossary>`, and introduce "
"a term at its first use."
msgstr "使用 :ref:`术语表 <reference-glossary>` 中的术语，并在首次使用时给出定义。"

#: ../../contributing.rst:103
msgid "Write times in UTC and in ISO 8601, and amounts with the unit credits."
msgstr "时间使用 UTC 和 ISO 8601 格式书写，金额带单位“额度”。"

#: ../../contributing.rst:104
msgid ""
"Use ``hub.example.com`` for hosts and an obviously fictitious value for "
"an AID. Do not publish keys, tokens or the names of internal hosts."
msgstr "主机使用 ``hub.example.com``，AID 使用明显虚构的值。不得公布密钥、令牌或内部主机名。"

#: ../../contributing.rst:106
msgid ""
"Examples are complete and runnable. Mark commands with ``.. code-block:: "
"console`` and structured data with ``json``."
msgstr "示例应完整且可运行。命令以 ``.. code-block:: console`` 标注，结构化数据以 ``json`` 标注。"

#: ../../contributing.rst:108
msgid "Cross-reference with ``:ref:`` and ``:doc:``."
msgstr "交叉引用使用 ``:ref:`` 与 ``:doc:``\\ 。"

#: ../../contributing.rst:111
msgid "Translation"
msgstr "翻译"

#: ../../contributing.rst:113
msgid ""
"The Chinese text is written to read naturally and not word for word, in "
"the same register. Extract and update the catalogs with:"
msgstr "中文译文按通顺自然的原则撰写，不逐字对译，语体保持一致。提取和更新目录的命令如下："

#: ../../contributing.rst:121
msgid ""
"Terms follow the glossary. Command lines, configuration keys, codes and "
"paths are not translated."
msgstr "术语遵循术语表。命令行、配置键、代码和路径不翻译。"

#: ../../contributing.rst:125
msgid "Licensing of contributions"
msgstr "贡献的许可"

