#: ../../contributing.rst:135
msgid "Security reports"
msgstr "安全报告"

#: ../../contributing.rst:137
msgid ""
"Report a suspected vulnerability by email to ``hi@anet0.com`` with the "
"subject ``[SECURITY]``."
msgstr "怀疑存在漏洞时，请发送邮件至 ``hi@anet0.com``，主题为 ``[SECURITY]``\\ 。"

